  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of failure to demonstrate compliance with Building Regulations M4 (2) (accessible and adaptable dwellings) and insufficient private amenity space and floor-to-ceiling height, is considered to represent a poor standard of accommodation. As such, the proposed development is in conflict with Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM10 and DM13 of the Core Strategy (2012) and Residential Design SPD (2013).",
    "The proposed car parking arrangements for retained No. 2 could not be accessed independently and could not be used without illegal manoeuvring on the public highway. The proposed development would likely cause pedestrian and highway safety issues contrary to Paragraph 186 of the NPPF (2024), Policies T5, T6 and T6.1 of the London Plan (2021), and Policy DM10 of the Kingston Core Strategy(2012)."
  ],
